# Route: guide 45 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to 59, 72
# quests, 2.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Loch Modan, The Hinterlands, Duskwood, Ironforge, Teldrassil, Swamp of
# Sorrows, Burning Steppes, Elwynn Forest): Valley of Kings -> Thelsamar ->
# Grizzlepaw Ridge -> Ironband's Excavation Site -> North Gate Pass ->
# Ironband's Excavation Site -> Stonewrought Dam -> Silver Stream Mine ->
# Stonewrought Dam -> Aerie Peak -> Quel'Danil Lodge -> The Overlook Cliffs ->
# The Creeping Ruin -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): A Dark Threat Looms (278; Mo'grosh
# Ogre 18-19, Mo'grosh Enforcer 18-19, Mo'grosh Brute 19-20, Mo'grosh Shaman
# 18-19, Mo'grosh Mystic 19-20, Emogg the Crusher 19); The Super Snapper FX
# (2944; Gammerita 48); The Star, the Hand and the Heart (735; Grel'borg the
# Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44); An Ambassador of Evil
# (762; Ambassador Infernus 42); Oakenscowl (2499; Oakenscowl 9); Morganth
# (249; Morganth 26).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Jammal'an the Prophet (1446), Crime and Punishment (377),
# Crime and Punishment (377), Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the
# Deeps (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050),
# The Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the
# Necklace (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924),
# Essential Artificials (2924), The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal
# (2929), Data Rescue (2930), Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341),
# The Fate of the Kingdom (4362), The Restless Dead (96394), The Restless Dead
# (96394), An Ancient Grudge (96395), Important Heirlooms (96403), Important
# Heirlooms (96403), The Treaty of Understanding (98423), In Search of
# Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199), Dark Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of
# Flame (4024), The Heart of the Mountain (4123), Marshal Windsor (4241),
# Incendius! (4263), Put Her Down (4701), Egg Freezing (4734), Egg Collection
# (4735), Doomrigger's Clasp (4764), Maxwell's Mission (5081), General
# Drakkisath's Demise (5102).

